# WPE WebKit cross-build dependencies — armhf dev packages, pinned by version + sha256.
# Generated from a working build; consumed by stage-sysroot-atlas.sh (phase: webkit-deps).
#
# Format:  <package>=<version>|<sha256>
#
# Suites are declared in stage-sysroot-atlas.sh's sources.list. Versions are chosen to MATCH THE
# SONAMES THE DEVICE SHIPS, not to be current:
#   libicu-dev 70.1        - ICU mangles every symbol with its major (u_strToUpper_70). Headers from
#                            any other ICU will not link against the device's libicuuc.so.70.
#   libgstreamer* 1.20.1   - device ships GStreamer 1.20.7
#   libjpeg62-turbo-dev    - device ships libjpeg.so.62 (Debian naming; Ubuntu's is libjpeg.so.8)
#   libcairo2-dev 1.18.4   - device ships cairo 1.18.0
# Most of the rest are transitive pkg-config dependencies: without their .pc files, pkg-config fails
# and WebKit's Find modules silently fall back to header-scraping and report bogus versions.
